text:
Light snow yesterday gets the plows &salters out to turn a bike lane with a thin snow layer (totally rideable) into a bike lane covered in corduroy ice ridges (unrideable) courtesy of a plow/salter driving over the snowbanks on either side. Every time.
@mayoroliviachow.ca
@diannesaxe.bsky.social

From 1st March the Islington police station will no longer be open 24/7

Will police vehicles still be parked in the mandatory 24/7 (no loading at any time) C50 cycle lanes outside? 

